    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #358\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nWorking tree had no remaining changes to commit. Pushed the new commit to the existing branch `bb/relay-147-system-i18n-05-05-localize-api-and-age-thr_pvk76vsc8d` on origin.\n\n## Summary\n\nThis push addresses the AI Code Review feedback on PR #358 for issue #147:\n\n- **Fixed the MEDIUM finding**: the unchecked cast on `p.config.options` in `permissionManifest.ts` is replaced with a runtime type guard (`filterValidOptions`), now centralized in a shared `catalogResolution.ts` module used by both the permission manifest and the new API schema projection.\n- **Fixed the LOW finding**: added test coverage for `multi_select` property options, exercising the same resolution path as `select`.\n- **Closed the dominant acceptance-criteria gap**: implemented a real, authenticated `GET /api/schema` endpoint in `services/semprec-api` that resolves database names, property names, option labels, view-type names, and module-declared agent-tool labels — strictly from the authenticated user's `users.locale`, with no query/body override, canonical keys preserved alongside labels, and explicit stored overrides always winning. Includes integration tests covering cs/en/fallback/override behavior against the live endpoint.\n\nAll checks pass: unit (127/127), integration (803/803), e2e (5/5), lint, format, and dependency-boundary checks are all clean.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
