    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #358\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nWorking tree had no remaining changes to commit. Pushed the new commit to the existing branch `bb/relay-147-system-i18n-05-05-localize-api-and-age-thr_pvk76vsc8d` on origin.\n\n## Summary\n\nThis push addresses the second round of AI Code Review feedback on PR #358 for issue #147:\n\n- **Medium (blocking)**: fixed an N+1 query in `generateSchemaProjection` — added a batched `listPropertiesByDatabases` function (one query, grouped by `database_id` in memory) instead of one query per database in the system-wide schema endpoint.\n- **Low**: `filterValidOptions` now also rejects a select/multi_select option whose `label` is present but not a string, closing the gap where only `key` was type-checked.\n- **Low**: `schemaHandler.ts` now authenticates before checking the HTTP method — an unauthenticated non-GET request to `/api/schema` correctly returns 401, and an authenticated non-GET request returns 405 instead of both being masked as 404.\n- **Clarified AC #9**: documented in `GeneratePermissionManifestOptions` that no code in this repo renders AGENT.md or runs an agent at runtime yet, so there's no production caller to thread `users.locale` through today — the `locale` option is ready for that future runtime.\n\nAll checks pass: unit (127/127), integration (806/806), e2e (5/5), lint, format, and dependency-boundary checks are all clean.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
